[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from August 31, 2005 titled 'Lessons from WinFS'.
[00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.600]   Microsoft put WinFS into beta today, so it seems like a good time to talk about WinFS and what it
